{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hant",
  "strings": {
    "一個必要權限，約一分鐘": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "One required permission, about one minute"}}}},
    "點一下文字框，按住 %@ 說話，放開後按 Command-V 貼上辨識結果。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Click the text field, hold %@ while speaking, then press Command-V to paste the result."}}}},
    "用於自動貼上文字（選用）": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Used for automatic paste (optional)"}}}},
    "沒有輔助使用權限也能使用快捷鍵；辨識結果會複製到剪貼簿，請按 Command-V 貼上。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "The shortcut works without Accessibility; text will be copied to the clipboard. Press Command-V to paste."}}}},
    "已啟用自動貼上": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Automatic paste enabled"}}}},
    "未啟用自動貼上": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Automatic paste unavailable"}}}},
    "輔助使用是選用權限；未啟用時，辨識結果會留在剪貼簿，請按 Command-V 貼上。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Accessibility is optional; without it, text stays on the clipboard. Press Command-V to paste."}}}},
    "文字已複製": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Text Copied"}}}},
    "已複製文字，請按 Command-V 貼上": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Text copied. Press Command-V to paste."}}}},
    "LaSay 只在你按住快捷鍵時錄音，並把辨識結果貼到目前的 App。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "LaSay records only while you hold the shortcut, then pastes the result into the current app."}}}},
    "全域快捷鍵：%@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Global shortcut: %@"}}}},
    "請按住 %@ 說話，放開後自動辨識": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Hold %@ while speaking; release to transcribe automatically"}}}},
    "點一下文字框，按住 %@ 說話，放開後 LaSay 會把結果貼進來。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Click the text box, hold %@ while speaking, then release. LaSay will paste the result here."}}}},
    "一般": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "General"}}}},
    "允許": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Allow"}}}},
    "兩個權限，約一分鐘": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Two permissions, about one minute"}}}},
    "在系統設定確認登入項目": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Confirm Login Items in System Settings"}}}},
    "成功！LaSay 已經可以在任何 App 使用。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Success! LaSay now works in any app."}}}},
    "按住 %@ 說話，放開後自動輸入": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Hold %@ to speak; release to type"}}}},
    "按住說話快捷鍵": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Push-to-talk shortcut"}}}},
    "提示：短按不會錄音，請按住、說話、再放開。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tip: Hold the shortcut, speak, then release."}}}},
    "檢查更新...": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Check for Updates..."}}}},
    "權限開啟後會自動繼續，不必重新啟動 App。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Permissions are detected automatically. You do not need to restart the app."}}}},
    "用來接收快捷鍵並貼上文字": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Receives the shortcut and pastes text"}}}},
    "用來錄下你說的話": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Records what you say"}}}},
    "登入後自動啟動 LaSay": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Launch LaSay at login"}}}},
